https://github.com/AtomGraph/Web-Client/commit/c14091ef9d80a4ce3feab2706b1306329b3504c1","commit_subject":"The xhtml: mode namespace narrows to what its pun can honestly claim: childless element primitives whose mode name IS the emitted element's QName (Input, Anchor, Option, Title, Meta, Script) - one element, attributes as parameters, content at most a text label. Every mode with element structure inside is a component and moves to the component namespace under the design system's name for its surface: xhtml:Body becomes ac:AppShell, xhtml:Head ac:Head, xhtml:Style ac:Stylesheets (which also retires the one name that never matched its output - it emits link elements), the table family becomes ac:ResultsTable/-HeaderCell/-DataCell/-DataCellValue (ResultsTable, not DataTable: the fixed-column core table already owns that name downstream), and the property-list pair dt/dd becomes ac:PropertyListLabel/ac:PropertyListValue. The caller-less xhtml:ListItem template goes outright. CLAUDE.md states the rule: element identity in xhtml:, structure in component namespaces, the unnamed mode as the value leaf.","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"civitai/civitai","commit_timestamp":"2026-09-08T23:23:43Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"935b37ddaae70b4dd4902e5e40e992c7cfaef72a","github_link":"https://github.com/civitai/civitai/commit/935b37ddaae70b4dd4902e5e40e992c7cfaef72a","commit_subject":"feat(training-studio): gate the app behind a Flipt closed-beta segment","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"Comfy-Org/ComfyUI_frontend","commit_timestamp":"2026-09-08T23:23:30Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"cf15ffd685afcec71a28fc8b580a7ea17bc7891b","github_link":"https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI_frontend/commit/cf15ffd685afcec71a28fc8b580a7ea17bc7891b","commit_subject":"Report layout listener failures to telemetry (#17040)","ai_tool":"Amp"},{"repo_name":"Dolibarr/dolibarr","commit_timestamp":"2026-09-08T23:23:06Z","branch":"develop","commit_sha":"1584753c4f5d71e363c6618dbed385f54af275a5","gi